          </p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3.5"><a class="w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#2563EB] hover:bg-[#1D4ED8] text-white font-medium text-base shadow-card transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2" href="#contact">微信联系购买 · ¥6.8</a><a class="w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-[#F7F8FA] text-[#172033] font-medium text-base border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-subtle transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2" href="#download"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#64748B]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>免费试用 3 天</span></a></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[#64748B]">
