              </p></div><div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#E2E8F0] font-mono text-[11px] flex items-center justify-between text-[#64748B]"><span>查看日志 &gt;</span><span class="text-[#1A2B4C] bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#E2E8F0]">毫秒级诊断</span></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F8FA] border border-[#E2E8F0] flex flex-col justify-between"><div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-[#2563EB]"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-semibold text-[#172033]">本地授权验证</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#64748B] leading-relaxed">
