0 bg-white border-y border-[#E2E8F0] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" id="tutorial"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="max-w-2xl"><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[#2563EB]">Quick Start Guide</span><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#172033]">使用与授权说明</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#64748B]">KeyGuard 提供 3 天试用；购买后使用有效激活码在客户端完成本地授权验证。</p></div><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><article class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F8FA] border border-[#E2E8F0]"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#2563EB]">01</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold">获取软件</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#64748B]">通过微信联系了解软件获取方式。</p></article><article class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F8FA] border border-[#E2E8F0]"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#2563EB]">02</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold">开始试用</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#64748B]">首次运行可体验 3 天试用，按需调整防抖时间。</p></article><article class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F8FA] border border-[#E2E8F0]"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#2563EB]">03</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold">本地激活</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#64748B]">购买后联系获取激活码，在客户端输入后由 Ed25519 公钥进行本地签名验证；无需连接授权服务器，也无需断开网络。</p></article></div></div></section><section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" id="faq"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[#2563EB]">FAQ</span><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#172033]">常见问题解答</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#64748B]">关于功能、试用与授权方式的说明。</p></div><div class="space-y-3"><details class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm">KeyGuard 是什么？</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B]">KeyGuard 是 Windows 键盘重复输入过滤工具，可按键盘事件间隔识别并过滤短间隔重复输入，并提供本地诊断日志。</p></details><details class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm">支持哪些系统？</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B]">产品目标系统为 Windows 10 / 11 64 位。</p></details><details class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm">如何试用？</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B]">首次运行提供 3 天免费试用。</p></details><details class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm">授权如何使用？</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B]">授权为一次性购买、永久使用。激活码通过 Ed25519 签名在客户端本地验证，无需注册账号，也不需要连接授权服务器或刻意断开网络。</p></details><details class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm">是否限制设备数量？</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B]">不绑定设备，不限制本人使用设备数量；授权为个人使用，不允许转售或转授权。</p></details><details class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm">怎样购买？</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B]">请通过页面中的微信联系方式咨询购买与交付信息。</p></details><details class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm">退款政策是什么？</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B]">KeyGuard 提供 3 天免费试用，建议用户在购买前充分体验软件功能。如软件存在经确认且无法解决的技术故障，导致核心功能无法正常使用，用户可通过微信联系客服申请退款。其他退款事项按照适用法律法规及相关规定处理。退款申请需提供订单信息，以便核实处理。</p></details></div></div></section></main><section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white border-t border-[#E2E8F0]" id="contact"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#F7F8FA] border border-[#E2E8F0] p-6 sm:p-10"><img alt="微信客服二维码 bunny1442" class="w-40 h-40 rounded-xl bg-white object-contain" src="/images/wechat-bunny1442.png"/><div><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[#2563EB]">CONTACT</span><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-[#172033]">微信联系购买与反馈</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#64748B] leading-relaxed">微信号：<strong class="text-[#1720